<</Title(How local System-One models compare to TypeSafe's Jev when assisting in the Operating Room)/Subject(Can a local 2B System-One model control virtual operating-room equipment quickly and accurately? I compare JevK5-2B on an RTX 2080 with TypeSafe's Jev. Hosting it locally is feasible, but this setup falls behind on accuracy and latency.)/Keywords(System One, Jev, JevK5, Medicine, Rust, Analysis)/Author(Tim Peko (TimerErTim))/Creator(Typst 0.15.1)/ModDate(D:20261022225752+02'00)/CreationDate(D:20261022225752+02'00)>>
